# Commands: use `just` only

- Do **not** run `ruff`, `uvx ruff`, `pytest`, `mypy`, or similar tools directly (including via `uv run`) for this repo.
- Use **`just fix`** for automated lint/format/SQL/Terraform fixes (never bare `ruff` or `uvx ruff`).
- Use **`just check-all`** before considering work complete or reporting back to the user (full project check).
- See `AGENTS.md` Development Workflow for the full policy.
